import{_ as e,o,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 852 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | Hyper-Multiverse Construction of Symbiosis Philosophy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 852 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | Hyper-Multiverse Construction of Symbiosis Philosophy","no":852,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Symbiosis Philosophy","Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Circulation","Collective Uplift","Cosmology"],"related":["02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence","05-Myriad Ranks Joint Progress Basic Program","15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law","851-Transcended-One Philosophy Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0852_模块4-超脱者与哲学-共生哲学建构.md","filePath":"en/0852_模块4-超脱者与哲学-共生哲学建构.md"}'),s={name:"en/0852_模块4-超脱者与哲学-共生哲学建构.md"};function a(r,i,l,c,h,u){return o(),t("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-852-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-hyper-multiverse-construction-of-symbiosis-philosophy" tabindex="-1">Entry 852 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | Hyper-Multiverse Construction of Symbiosis Philosophy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-852-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-hyper-multiverse-construction-of-symbiosis-philosophy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 852 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy | Hyper-Multiverse Construction of Symbiosis Philosophy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 02, 05, 15, 851</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-cosmos-underlying-layer-is-circulation-not-conquest" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the cosmos&#39; underlying layer is &quot;circulation,&quot; not &quot;conquest&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-cosmos-underlying-layer-is-circulation-not-conquest" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the cosmos&#39; underlying layer is &quot;circulation,&quot; not &quot;conquest&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview&#39;s cosmology is the conqueror&#39;s cosmology: the strong conquer the weak, the higher devour the lower; the whole cosmos is like a food-chain pyramid, lonelier the higher you go. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cosmology is completely the opposite — <strong>the cosmos&#39; underlying layer is not the food chain, but bidirectional circulation.</strong> This is symbiosis philosophy. This entry explains: how the transcended one, at the hyper-multiverse scale, constructs &quot;symbiosis&quot; from a moral slogan into a philosophy about the cosmos&#39; essence.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally embody <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> and <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong>: symbiosis philosophy&#39;s cosmology is these two axioms&#39; metaphysical foundation; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> is symbiosis&#39; direct corollary; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires respecting circulation at the cross-plane scale, not interrupting it; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires symbiosis cosmology be self-consistent and stable.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-symbiosis-philosophy-s-core-myriad-rank-origin-bidirectional-circulation" tabindex="-1">I. Symbiosis Philosophy&#39;s Core: Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Circulation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-symbiosis-philosophy-s-core-myriad-rank-origin-bidirectional-circulation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Symbiosis Philosophy&#39;s Core: Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Circulation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Documents 02 and 15 reveal symbiosis philosophy&#39;s core — <strong>Myriad-Rank origin bidirectional circulation.</strong> Its meaning is:</p><ul><li>Myriad-Rank individuals cultivate, drawing energy from the cosmos origin;</li><li>After individuals complete cultivation, they feed back to the origin, making the origin fuller;</li><li>The fuller the origin, the more Myriad Ranks it can nourish;</li><li>This is a &quot;individual → collective → cosmos → individual&quot; positive cycle.</li></ul><p>The old world&#39;s model is &quot;stock allocation&quot; — energy is just that much; if you have more, I have less, so one must grab. Symbiosis philosophy&#39;s model is &quot;increment circulation&quot; — energy turns more and more through circulation; no need to grab. <strong>Once the cosmology changes, predation changes from &quot;inevitable&quot; to &quot;redundant.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="ii-hyper-multiverse-construction-from-one-star-to-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">II. Hyper-Multiverse Construction: From One Star to Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-hyper-multiverse-construction-from-one-star-to-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Hyper-Multiverse Construction: From One Star to Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiosis philosophy does not only apply to one planet. The transcended one constructs it to the hyper-multiverse scale:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Scale</th><th>Circulation Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Individual</td><td>Cultivation draws → individual uplift → feeds back to anchor</td></tr><tr><td>Clan</td><td>Each clan evolves → clan contributes → civilization benefits</td></tr><tr><td>Plane</td><td>Plane ecosystem → anchor network → cross-plane mutual aid</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmos</td><td>Cosmos origin → Myriad Ranks jointly uplift → origin fuller</td></tr><tr><td>Multiverse</td><td>Cross-cosmos anchor network → new-cosmos frontier → overall uplift</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The larger and steadier this circulation. This is why the transcended one must do cross-plane anchor construction (entry 714) — he is expanding the circulation&#39;s radius, letting symbiosis&#39; returns cover more cosmoses.</p><h2 id="iii-why-symbiosis-outperforms-conquest-an-efficiency-argument" tabindex="-1">III. Why Symbiosis Outperforms Conquest: An Efficiency Argument <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-symbiosis-outperforms-conquest-an-efficiency-argument" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why Symbiosis Outperforms Conquest: An Efficiency Argument&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiosis philosophy is not only moral preaching; it has a cold efficiency argument:</p><ul><li><strong>Conquest model&#39;s ceiling</strong>: the stock you may devour is limited, and the devouring process damages ecosystems; the more you devour, the less; ultimately exhausted;</li><li><strong>Symbiosis model&#39;s ceiling</strong>: circulation is incremental; the more Myriad Ranks participate, the greater the output; no ceiling;</li><li><strong>Long-term</strong>: any conqueror ultimately cannot outrun the symbiont — because the symbiont stands on the &quot;turning more and more&quot; curve.</li></ul><p>This is entry 853&#39;s to-be-expanded &quot;anti-predation ultimate argument&quot; embryo. <strong>Symbiosis is not kinder, it is more sustainable.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-symbiosis-philosophy-and-the-individual-s-position" tabindex="-1">IV. Symbiosis Philosophy and the Individual&#39;s Position <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-symbiosis-philosophy-and-the-individual-s-position" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Symbiosis Philosophy and the Individual&#39;s Position&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiosis philosophy is most easily misunderstood as &quot;eliminating the individual.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou clarifies:</p><ul><li>Each individual in the circulation is a real link — without individuals, circulation breaks;</li><li>The individual is not asked to &quot;sacrifice himself to fulfill the collective,&quot; but &quot;fulfill himself in circulation&quot;;</li><li>Document 26&#39;s individual-collective balance principle is symbiosis philosophy&#39;s guardrail: circulation amplifies the collective, also protects the individual.</li></ul><p>Symbiosis is not &quot;Myriad Ranks are one iron plate,&quot; but &quot;Myriad Ranks are a living circulation; every cell matters.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: understand the cosmos as incremental circulation, avoiding the conqueror&#39;s ultimate waste of &quot;devouring less and less&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: symbiosis philosophy proves predation does not hold cosmologically — it damages circulation, cuts its own retreat</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo cosmology is the food-chain conquest model; Heng Yuan Zhou is the bidirectional-circulation symbiosis model</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the larger the circulation radius, the better; all five-lineage life is a circulation participant</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: symbiosis cosmology&#39;s demonstration, circulation model, and cross-cosmos practice all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-circulation-s-empirical-evidence-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Circulation&#39;s Empirical Evidence and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-circulation-s-empirical-evidence-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Circulation&#39;s Empirical Evidence and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiosis philosophy is not empty talk; it must be verified by Myriad Ranks&#39; real life. The anchor network continuously monitors circulation&#39;s health degree: Myriad-Rank access rate, energy return volume, feedback scale — these data are symbiosis philosophy&#39;s empirical evidence for whether it holds. The transcended one&#39;s contributions to maintaining and expanding circulation are counted into civilizational weight by its effect of making circulation &quot;turn larger and larger&quot;; any behavior that attempts to damage circulation or take predatory short-cuts is identified and blocked by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. This evidence-metering-supervision closed loop turns symbiosis philosophy from &quot;faith&quot; into &quot;data-supported cosmology.&quot; The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm firmly stands on the side of circulation precisely because circulation is not only more beautiful, but proven more sustainable.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The cosmos&#39; underlying layer is circulation, not conquest. Symbiosis philosophy&#39;s hyper-multiverse construction upgrades &quot;Myriad-Rank symbiosis&quot; from a moral warmth into a metaphysics about the cosmos&#39; essence — the cosmos is an incremental circulation that turns more and more; Myriad Ranks are this circulation&#39;s joint masters, not prey devouring each other. When the transcended one maintains this circulation and expands this circulation at the cross-cosmos scale, he stands on the cosmos&#39; most fundamental direction. This is symbiosis philosophy&#39;s ultimate power: <strong>it is not persuading Myriad Ranks to be good people; it is telling Myriad Ranks — walking along circulation is walking along the cosmos.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">Entry 02 · Anchor Origin Definition and Essence</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad Ranks Joint Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Circulation and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/851_模块4-超脱者与哲学-总论.html">Entry 851 · Transcended-One Philosophy Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const y=e(s,[["render",a]]);export{m as __pageData,y as default};
